// FRONTIER & PHILOSOPHY VOYAGER  |  L14 — Indigenous & Curandero Ways of Knowing
// Age band : voyagers (11-12)   Guide: orion (Phoenix)
// Standards: Coreverse Original — Philosophy, Epistemology, Comparative Philosophy, Ethics
// CALIBRATED: Voyager spec v1.1 (May 2026)
//
// SUBJECT NOTE — Frontier & Philosophy:
//   - Serious, respectful engagement with Indigenous philosophies and ways of knowing, and with
//     curanderismo (Latin American folk-healing traditions). Continues the "different ways of
//     knowing" thread from L13 (Eastern philosophy) and the epistemology thread from the
//     knowledge lesson. Treats these as genuine knowledge-systems and philosophies, not folklore.
//   - HERITAGE SENSITIVITY (calibration-critical): the platform founder is Colombian; her
//     children (primary test users) have Latin American heritage and may have family connection
//     to curanderismo. Handle with genuine respect and WITHOUT romanticizing, exoticizing, or
//     reducing to "magic." Present on its own terms: relational, place-based, communal,
//     experiential, often holistic (body/mind/community/land together). Be accurate and humble;
//     do not speak as an authority initiating anyone into anything; do not give how-to ritual or
//     medical instruction.
//   - PROTECTIVE BACKBONE (two-sided, essential): (1) Take seriously the real, tested knowledge
//     in these traditions — deep ecological knowledge, plant/botanical knowledge (source of real
//     medicines), the communal/relational model of wellbeing, and the philosophical insight that
//     the modern "separate individual vs. inert nature" picture is not the only or obviously
//     best one. Much was wrongly dismissed by colonizers and is now being re-validated. (2) BUT
//     respect is not credulity: not every traditional claim is accurate, traditions themselves
//     update, and there is a large commodified "plastic shaman / buy-your-healing-retreat"
//     industry that exploits and distorts these traditions for profit. The mature stance, again:
//     deep respect AND clear thinking, plus a new note here — humility about what's not ours to
//     claim or sell.
//   - SAFETY: do NOT provide medical advice, do not endorse replacing medical care, do not give
//     instructions for ingesting plants/substances. Keep it philosophical and respectful.
//   - EVENHANDED; honesty tiers 2-3. Em-dashes natural; do NOT run em-dash replacement.
//
// Interaction format: MATCHING (screen 7). Matches <Matching />: pairs:[{id,left,right}] where
// left = a way-of-knowing concept/term, right = what it means or is good at. + headline, intro.
// (Audit-confirmed simplest matching contract.)
//
// QUIZ STANDARD (locked): 8 MC + 1 TF + 1 inference. Short ~1-line options, comparable length,
// plausible misconception distractors, correct rotated/not-longest; teaching in `explanation`.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

